#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to update your project so that it works with Qiskit 1.0."
msgstr "Paano i-update ang iyong proyekto para gumana sa Qiskit 1.0."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit 1.0 migration guide"
msgstr "Gabay sa migration ng Qiskit 1.0"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit 1.0 migration guide {#qiskit-10-migration-guide}"
msgstr "Gabay sa migration ng Qiskit 1.0 {#qiskit-10-migration-guide}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit 1.0 brings new stability guarantees and performance improvements, but it\n"
"does break compatibility with all previous versions of Qiskit. See the\n"
"following guides on updating your environment and code to work with Qiskit v1.0.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang Qiskit 1.0 ay nagdadala ng mga bagong garantiya sa katatagan at mga "
"pagpapabuti sa performance, ngunit hindi ito compatible sa lahat ng "
"nakaraang bersyon ng Qiskit. Tingnan ang mga sumusunod na gabay para ma-"
"update ang iyong environment at code para gumana sa Qiskit v1.0.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Install the new Qiskit v1.0 package](/guides/qiskit-1.0-installation) for "
"upgrading Python environments and project dependencies.\n"
msgstr ""
"[I-install ang bagong Qiskit v1.0 package](/guides/qiskit-1.0-installation) "
"para sa pag-upgrade ng mga Python environment at project dependencies.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Qiskit v1.0 feature changes](/guides/qiskit-1.0-features) for updating your"
" code.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Mga pagbabago sa features ng Qiskit v1.0](/guides/qiskit-1.0-features) para"
" sa pag-update ng iyong code.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Breaking package changes of Qiskit v1.0](/guides/metapackage-migration) to "
"understand the new and old package structure.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Mga breaking package changes ng Qiskit v1.0](/guides/metapackage-migration)"
" para maunawaan ang bago at lumang istraktura ng package.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read more about the benefits of Qiskit v1.0 on the [IBM&reg; "
"blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-1-0-release-summary).\n"
msgstr ""
"Basahin ang higit pa tungkol sa mga benepisyo ng Qiskit v1.0 sa [IBM&reg; "
"blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-1-0-release-summary).\n"
